// The first time in: the cave, the miners' warning, and the lights of the
// Team Eclipse dig below (run.lair.quarryDig hidden -> found). The dig
// itself is the contract beat south.moonstoneDig, once the three grunts at
// the ramps are beaten (@southDigOpen).

## The cave mouth

::bg{location="moonstone-cave" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="eerie" volume="down"}
@narrator: Moonstone Cave. The miners' ladders go down into the dark, and the dark smells of wet stone and lamp oil.
@narrator: Chalked on the first beam: "DUSKBATS SLEEP HERE. BE NICE." Underneath, in a different hand: "BE QUICK."

## The lights

::sfx{sound="pickaxe-far"}
@narrator: Far below, where no miner has worked in years, there are lights. White work lights, too many of them, and the tock-tock-tock of picks going all at once.
::set{run.lair.quarryDig = "found"}
@grunt: (echoing) Keep it moving! The Director wants the spiral beds cleared by the new moon!
@narrator: Three ramps lead down towards the lights. Each one has somebody in black standing at the top of it.
